## Notes: One addon for everything: a leveling route with a top-centre compass, quest automation and class trainer stops, auto-sell and repair, party tracker, Exchange auction scanner, death counter, and The Boys (gear upgrade popups, class guides, cooldown bar, professions). Replaces Wow Forever, Death Loop and TheBoys.
